Thank you for applying! 
We are pleased to inform you that your application has been approved!

You are approved for our standard lease terms, which is a 2 year lease. Please be aware that the rent does increase by $25/$50 on year 2 of all of our standard leases. The increase amount is based on the rent amount of the home you choose.

